    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This impressive four-bedroom detached home at 50 Dun Darrach, Dublin Road, Longford, is ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac and offers spacious, versatile accommodation perfect for modern family living. The property features four well-proportioned bedrooms and three bathrooms, including a convenient downstairs shower room. A welcoming family sitting room leads through to a bright, open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, creating an excellent space for everyday family life and entertaining. Off this is a separate utility room.The integrated garage is accessed directly from the hallway and offers excellent potential for conversion to additional living accommodation, subject to the necessary planning permissions and consents. Outside is a brick paved drive way for off street parking, to the rear is a private garden. Ideally located within walking distance of a range of local amenities, schools and shops, including Dunnes Stores and Lidl, this well-positioned family home combines generous accommodation, convenience and future potential. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n4.79m x 2.15m Tiled floor, carpeted stairs, radiator, power points, phone point, storage cupboard\n\nSitting Room\n4.76m x 3.74m Laminate flooring, bay window, 2 radiators, fireplace with timber surround cast iron inset and granite hearth, power points, tv point, double doors to dining room.\n\nDining Area\n4.52m x 2.82m Laminate flooring, radiator, sliding patio doors to rear garden, open plan style to kitchen.\n\nKitchen/Living\n7.43m x 3.07m Laminate flooring to the living area, tiled floor to the kitchen area, radiator, tv point, power points, solid wood shaker style kitchen, tiled splash back, integrated hob, oven, fridge freezer and dishwasher.\n\nUtility Room\n2.95m x 2.01m Tiled floor, fitted units, sink, power points, plumbed for appliances, radiator.\n\nShower Room\n2.66m x 1.39m Located on the ground floor, tiled floor, wc, whb, electric shower, extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 1\n2.80m x 2.49m Single bed at first floor level, laminate flooring, radiator, power points.\n\nMain Bedroom\n5.09m x 3.44m Laminate flooring, radiator, power points, tv point, phone point, en suite bathroom.\n\nEn-suite\n1.58m x 1.58m Tiled floor, tiled shower, wc, whb, radiator, ex tractor fan, shaving light, power shower.\n\nBathroom\n2.19m x 1.71m Bath with tiled surround and shower mixer, wc, whb, radiator, ex tractor fan, shaving light.\n\nBedroom 3\n3.83m x 3.15m Laminate flooring, radiator, power points, phone point, built in ward robe.\n\nBedroom 4\n2.75m x 2.42m Laminate flooring, radiator, power points.\n\nIntegrated Garage\n5.94m x 2.93m Up and over door, power points, light.\n\n"
      },
